 "insight": [
  "The combined share of Luxembourg's exports to Belgium, Germany and France increased from 46.3% in 2005 to 56.3% in 2025.",
  "The median share over the period 2005 to 2025 was 52.8%.",
  "The largest change between consecutive years was from 50.6% in 2019 to 55.3% in 2020.",
  "The share reached its lowest point in 2006 at 43.1%.",
  "These values are in current euros and are not adjusted for price changes."
